for Information Technology. The accompanying LICENSE preserves these terms.

This port changes the output to joint effort commands, rewrites the three-variable
QP as a fixed-size active-set solver, adds validated configurable tissue maps,
uses fixed damping in the power accounting, and reuses compensated FT input,
watchdogs and hardware effort limits. It does not copy the upstream compiled
qpOASES or MatLogger libraries, experimental data or automatic probe motions.
The upstream FDCC implementation and the torque port have different plant dynamics;
original experimental results are not hardware validation of this implementation.
